{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Rooms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create rooms.Set up your own office. Expand your office as you wish. Transform from a small office to a large company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/40515ac5c55ea3652ae1f3811df54ce8.poster.avif?t=1772898921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/40515ac5c55ea3652ae1f3811df54ce8.webm?t=1772898921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/40515ac5c55ea3652ae1f3811df54ce8.mp4?t=1772898921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Office Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the option to furnish your office space. Choose from various furniture items to keep your team comfortable and productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/4701134473df0f91f2e4bee0257d233f.poster.avif?t=1772898921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/4701134473df0f91f2e4bee0257d233f.webm?t=1772898921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/4701134473df0f91f2e4bee0257d233f.mp4?t=1772898921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hiring</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hire talented people. You will need staff for each department.You need to maintain balance in the office. You need to keep the happiness of the people you hire at a high level. You don\u2019t want to lose your talented employees to other companies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/ebf3bfadd4246894f6a9a83489571a79.poster.avif?t=1772898921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/ebf3bfadd4246894f6a9a83489571a79.webm?t=1772898921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/ebf3bfadd4246894f6a9a83489571a79.mp4?t=1772898921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own game projects. Increase your followers. Rock the charts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/d372ad808cbf7e47badcb62894537685.poster.avif?t=1772898921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/d372ad808cbf7e47badcb62894537685.webm?t=1772898921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/d372ad808cbf7e47badcb62894537685.mp4?t=1772898921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Employee Tracking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow those who try to escape from work with a camera and make them return to their work. Because you will have a specific schedule to finish the work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202250/extras/cf9978d3b9998b8089d72c1466e96dd0.poster.avif?t=1772898921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://sh